Rule 23    sensortype_or_var -> ID
Rule 24    instruction -> RENT EQUIPMENT COLON number_or_var COMMA hour_or_var COMMA hour_or_var COMMA date_or_var
Rule 25    reservation_status -> ACTIVE
Rule 26    reservation_status -> COMPLETED
Rule 27    reservation_status -> CANCELED
Rule 28    instruction -> GET RESERVATIONS
Rule 29    instruction -> GET RESERVATIONS number_or_var
Rule 30    instruction -> UPDATE RESERVATIONS number_or_var reservation_status
Rule 31    instruction -> REGISTER USER COLON STRING COMMA STRING COMMA NIF COMMA EMAIL COMMA ID COMMA PASSWORD COMMA USERTYPE
Rule 32    instruction -> REGISTER EQUIPMENT COLON HCID COMMA number_or_var
Rule 33    instruction -> GET RESOURCES
Rule 34    instruction -> GET RESOURCES number_or_var
Rule 35    instruction -> GET RESOURCES EQUIPMENT
Rule 36    instruction -> REGISTER EQUIPMENT COLON sensortype_or_var COMMA number_or_var COMMA float_or_var COMMA HCID
Rule 37    instruction -> GET EQUIPMENT
Rule 38    instruction -> GET EQUIPMENT SENSORTYPE
Rule 39    instruction -> GET EQUIPMENT FLOOR
Rule 40    instruction -> GET MOBILITY
Rule 41    instruction -> GET MOBILITY MOBILITY_TYPE
Rule 42    instruction -> REGISTER MOBILITY COLON MOBILITY_TYPE COMMA STRING COMMA HCID
Rule 43    instruction -> UPDATE MOBILITY number_or_var MOBILITY_STATUS
Rule 44    action -> RENT
Rule 45    action -> BUY
Rule 46    action -> REGISTER
Rule 47    action -> CANCEL

